    "detailed_description": "The World Has Been Infected By Dark Forces...<br>Since the Very Beginning they Were Here...<br>Throughout history they Have Been Reported...<br><br>But now, your time has come! You are called to withstand and overcome the enemy! With nothing more than a plain old board...<br><br><br>Cosmic Breakout is a clone of the classic game breakout: You control the board at the bottom of the screen and have to bounce off the ball to prevent losing a level and destroy the enemy-blocks at the same time. Unlike traditional breakout levels, the levels in this game consist of polygons. The precise collision mechanics lead to often unpredictable and always intense gameplay.<br><br>Be aware that this is a casual and short experience.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Classic breakout mechanics<br></li><li> Low-poly art style<br></li><li> Piece-by-piece destructible enemies<br></li><li> 5 intense levels<br></li><li> Great soundtracks</li></ul>",
